# ==============================================================================
# Flux Engine Operating Recipe: flux-estonia-136k.env
# Mode Alias:  --mode long-context-136k (136,584-token Ultra-Long-Context Reasoning)
# Pair With:   recipes/flux-serve.argv (override --max-seq-len 143360 --request-timeout 1800)
# Bridge:      source scripts/flux_env_bridge.sh --mode long-context-136k
# ==============================================================================
# Certified Performance (LIL v0.7.9 --test-profile estonia, N=5):
#   - Prompt Context:     136,576 - 136,584 tokens (707,468 chars; 6-hop Glass Current chain)
#   - Accuracy:           5/5 = 100.0% PASS (correctly resolves 'Estonia' past 'Latvia' decoy)
#   - Prefill Throughput: 5,400.4 tok/s median (TTFT 25.29s across 136.5K tokens)
#   - Decode Throughput:  48.2 tok/s client / 48.6 tok/s server (mean accept len 2.88)
#   - Memory Safety:      8,412 - 8,431+ MiB MemAvailable floor (0 watchdog kills)
#
# Architecture Notes:
#   Raises FP8 projection weight cache reserve guard to 10 GiB (`_RESERVE_GB=10`) for
#   144K KV-cache headroom, enforces `ATLAS_CTX_OVERFLOW_TRUNCATE=0` (fail-closed if
#   prompt exceeds `--max-seq-len`), and pins `ATLAS_QWEN4_QSA_VERIFY_ROWS=0` for
#   ultra-long-context QSA verification stability at >131K tokens.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Flux Public Branded Selectors (translated by scripts/flux_env_bridge.sh) ---
FLUX_MODE=long-context-136k
FLUX_QWEN4_PREFILL_WIDE=16384
FLUX_QWEN4_FAST_PROJ_FP8_WEIGHT_CACHE_RESERVE_GB=10
FLUX_QWEN4_QSA_VERIFY_ROWS=0
FLUX_CTX_OVERFLOW_TRUNCATE=0

